<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Dah Hwa shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Dah Hwa shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of leather trader and distributor Dah Hwa International (Holdings) Ltd was suspended on Tuesday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>On Friday, the company's shares rose HK$0.30 or 17.14 percent to HK$2.05 on volume of 15.39 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
